.TH ZION 1 "April 2026" "Zion 1.1.0" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
zion \- Zig package manager, toolchain manager, and testing workflow tool

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zion
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.RI [ OPTIONS ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Zion
is a Zig development tool that combines package management, Zig/ZLS environment management,
security workflows, and a Zion-native testing surface.

.SH CORE COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
Initialize a new Zig project.

.TP
.B add
Add a dependency to the current project.

.TP
.B remove , rm
Remove a dependency from the current project.

.TP
.B update
Update dependencies.

.TP
.B fetch
Fetch dependencies and cache them locally.

.TP
.B build
Build the project.

.TP
.B run
Run the project executable.

.TP
.B test
Run project tests or use the Zion-native test workflow.

.TP
.B doc
Generate or open project documentation.

.TP
.B help
Show command help.

.SH ANALYSIS AND HEALTH
.TP
.B check
Check project and dependency health.

.TP
.B tree
Display the dependency tree.

.TP
.B why
Explain why a dependency is present.

.TP
.B outdated
Check for outdated dependencies.

.TP
.B status
Show project status overview.

.SH LOCKING, HASHES, AND REPAIR
.TP
.B lock
Manage the lock file.

.TP
.B hash
Generate, verify, and update package hashes.

.TP
.B pin
Pin a dependency to a specific version.

.TP
.B unpin
Unpin a dependency and resume tracking updates.

.TP
.B repair
Attempt repair of dependency or hash problems.

.SH ZIG AND TOOLING
.TP
.B zig
Manage Zig versions.

.TP
.B zls
Manage ZLS setup and diagnostics.

.TP
.B setup
Show lightweight onboarding and verification guidance.

.TP
.B workspace
Manage workspaces.

.TP
.B nvim
Neovim integration helpers.

.SH REGISTRIES, SECURITY, AND POLICY
.TP
.B registry
Manage configured registries and connectivity.

.TP
.B security
Security and trust workflows.

.TP
.B keyring
GPG keyring management and signature verification helpers.

.TP
.B verify
Signature verification helpers.

.TP
.B policy
Package trust policy management.

.TP
.B publish
Publish a package.

.SH TEST WORKFLOW
.TP
.B zion test
Run standard project tests.

.TP
.B zion test bootstrap
Prepare the Zion-native test workflow layout.

.TP
.B zion test scaffold
Write the canonical suite to
.I tests/zion_test_suite.zig .

.TP
.B zion test run
Run the Zion-native workflow suite.

.TP
.B zion test bench
Run benchmark-focused workflow cases.

.TP
.B zion test ci
Run CI profile workflow cases.

.TP
.B zion test report
Generate a structured report under
.I .zion/test/reports/ .

.SH TEST WORKFLOW OPTIONS
.TP
.B --seed
Set a reproducible workflow seed.

.TP
.B --cases
Set the workflow case count.

.TP
.B --time-budget
Set workflow time budget in milliseconds.

.TP
.B --include
Include only matching workflow test cases.

.TP
.B --exclude
Exclude matching workflow test cases.

.TP
.B --failed-only
Re-run only previously failed workflow cases.

.TP
.B --ci-profile
Select a workflow profile such as
.I default
or
.I hardened .

.SH FILES
.TP
.I build.zig.zon
Project manifest.

.TP
.I zion.lock
Lock file.

.TP
.I .zion/cache/
Downloaded package cache.

.TP
.I .zion/deps/
Extracted dependencies.

.TP
.I .zion/test/
Zion-native test workflow artifacts.

.SH REQUIREMENTS
.TP
Zig 0.16.0-dev or newer
.TP
curl
.TP
tar
.TP
git

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zig (1)

